MorphIconGeometry.kt adapts the core Procrustes alignment, subpath matching,
polar interpolation and interruptible spring to portable Kotlin.
Compose uses its own finite frame clock and canonical vector resources at rest.
XML icon geometry remains the project's existing Lucide and custom outline data.
Operation glyphs use outlines; brand artwork is preserved. No JavaScript runtime is included.
Hover, pressed and selected poses are authored for Podor's operation glyphs.
They use the same finite morph driver and do not animate while settled.
